# Windows-only tooling repository.
#
# Disable all end-of-line conversion. These files were extracted byte-for-byte
# from J:\audio\VAD, where they are stored with CRLF endings. PowerShell,
# cmd.exe, and the pane scripts all expect CRLF. Normalizing them would change
# the bytes and break the byte-identity guarantee against the source.
#
# Do not add "text=auto" here.
* -text
